{
  "description": "R4: at 5,000 links the browser builds at most 60 row nodes whose text matches the fixture rows in order, End brings row 5000 into the tree, and its first frame takes < 100 ms",
  "requirement": "R4 (GPUI Phase 1)",
  "notes": [
    "setup.graph seeds graph-5000.json. Rows are in ubilink-app's list_links order (updated_at DESC, rowid DESC; a seeded resource's updated_at is its created_at), the Tauri browser's order (B1), so the first rows and row 5000 are known.",
    "The first-frame time is the view_first_frame sample the browser records in the metrics ring (automation/store.rs MetricKind::ViewFirstFrame, timed at present). Only the browser view is ever shown in this instance, so every view_first_frame sample is the browser's. It is read before any a11y call, since activating the a11y tree makes every later frame slower.",
    "size_of_set on a row is what gpui-component's List reports for the whole list: 5000 proves all links are in the list while at most 60 rows are built.",
    "Rows are matched by URI and by name in their subtree (deep), see README contract."
  ],
  "setup": {
    "graph": "graph-5000.json"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "graph": true,
      "resource_count": 5000,
      "link_count": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "open the browser",
      "call": "trigger_hotkey",
      "args": {
        "action": "browser"
      },
      "expect": {
        "shell.visible": true,
        "route": "browser"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "first frame < 100 ms (timed at present, before any a11y call)",
      "call": "metrics",
      "retry_ms": 3000,
      "expect": {
        "summary.view_first_frame.count": {
          "ge": 1
        },
        "summary.view_first_frame.max": {
          "lt": 100
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "virtualised: between 1 and 60 row nodes",
      "see": {
        "role": "ListItem"
      },
      "min_count": 1,
      "max_count": 60,
      "route": "browser",
      "timeout_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "name": "the list holds all 5000 links",
      "see": {
        "role": "ListItem",
        "nth": 0,
        "state": {
          "size_of_set": 5000
        }
      },
      "route": "browser"
    },
    {
      "name": "rows match the fixture's first rows in order (URIs and names)",
      "see": [
        {
          "sequence": {
            "role": "ListItem",
            "texts": [
              "https://fixture-00231.example.test/resource",
              "https://fixture-04996.example.test/resource",
              "https://fixture-00041.example.test/resource",
              "https://fixture-02776.example.test/resource",
              "https://fixture-01175.example.test/resource"
            ],
            "mode": "prefix",
            "deep": true
          }
        },
        {
          "sequence": {
            "role": "ListItem",
            "texts": [
              "Resource 00231",
              "Resource 04996",
              "Resource 00041",
              "Resource 02776",
              "Resource 01175"
            ],
            "mode": "prefix",
            "deep": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "route": "browser"
    },
    {
      "name": "row 5000 not built yet",
      "see": {
        "role": "ListItem",
        "text": "https://fixture-04747.example.test/resource",
        "deep": true
      },
      "absent": true,
      "route": "browser",
      "timeout_ms": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "End",
      "call": "key",
      "args": {
        "keys": "end"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "row 5000 is in the tree",
      "see": {
        "role": "ListItem",
        "text": "https://fixture-04747.example.test/resource",
        "deep": true
      },
      "route": "browser",
      "timeout_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "name": "still at most 60 row nodes",
      "see": {
        "role": "ListItem"
      },
      "min_count": 1,
      "max_count": 60,
      "route": "browser"
    },
    {
      "name": "the first row is no longer built",
      "see": {
        "role": "ListItem",
        "text": "https://fixture-00231.example.test/resource",
        "deep": true
      },
      "absent": true,
      "route": "browser"
    },
    {
      "name": "nothing launched",
      "call": "opened",
      "expect": {
        "": {
          "eq": []
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
